#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:3
#: 64db73b6fd4046ee806496d7df9141e7
msgid "层错构型（Stacking Fault）"
msgstr "Stacking Fault"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:5
#: d4def285c075421cbe4b7333c93838f0
msgid "`Group`: `Defect` | `Class`: `StackingFaultCard`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:7
#: 85943225459e430ab41fa4ff8f58bde9
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "What the card does"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:9
#: b4e37e94d0504fd5bf6989de86833bb0
msgid "沿指定 Miller 晶面做相对滑移，生成不同位移量的层错结构。选定 hkl 晶面后，从指定层开始将上层原子整体平移，扫描位移步长覆盖堆垛错配路径。"
msgstr ""
"Generate stacking-fault structures by shifting atoms above a selected layer "
"relative to atoms below a Miller plane. Scan displacement along the in-plane"
" slip path."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:11
#: 1e24b819f9fb4e25bf38e7d22fdb6f20
msgid ""
"\\mathbf{n}=\\frac{h\\mathbf{b}_1+k\\mathbf{b}_2+l\\mathbf{b}_3}{|h\\mathbf{b}_1+k\\mathbf{b}_2+l\\mathbf{b}_3|},\\quad"
" \\hat{\\mathbf{s}}\\perp\\mathbf{n},\\quad "
"\\mathbf{r}'_i=\\mathbf{r}_i+\\hat{\\mathbf{s}}\\Delta d\\ (\\text{if } "
"\\mathbf{r}_i\\cdot\\mathbf{n} \\ge z_{\\text{plane}})"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:13
#: 6d47f90c1165445294b6a1176a6dce19
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example workflow"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:15
#: ec8af0bb7a7d4def8d83bfef48615465
msgid "场景：模型在层错能曲线上完全失真"
msgstr "Scenario: The stacking-fault energy curve is qualitatively wrong"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:17
#: 6f42b59cd0a040749ce5c52ae560a2ca
msgid ""
"你在 fcc Cu 上训练了一个 NEP 模型，体相弹性能和力都很好。然后你尝试算 (111) 面的广义层错能（GSFE）曲线——模型预测的层错能是 "
"DFT 参考值的 3 倍，曲线形状也不对。"
msgstr ""
"An fcc Cu NEP reproduces bulk energies and forces but predicts a (111) GSFE "
"three times too high with the wrong curve shape."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:19
#: 97be2f1df27143ae8430703d27ba35f6
msgid ""
"**诊断思路：** GSFE "
"曲线是体系在不同滑移位移下的能量响应。训练集里所有结构都是完美晶体，没有任何原子层之间发生了相对位移的构型。模型对\"层间滑移\"这个自由度的能量函数完全靠外推。需要沿目标滑移方向生成一组已知位移量的层错结构。"
msgstr ""
"**Diagnosis:** GSFE measures energy as one part of a crystal slides relative"
" to another. Perfect-crystal data contain no such degree of freedom. Add "
"controlled displacements along the target slip system and label them with "
"DFT."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:21
#: 2140ffb4271a48289606600eeada8259
msgid "**输入：** 一个 fcc Cu 的超胞，c 轴已沿 [111] 方向"
msgstr "**Input:** An fcc Cu supercell with c aligned to [111]."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:23
#: 0c14c5ce2c7d40c7aa9b0dcd7b4b56fa
msgid "**目标：** 沿 (111) 面，从 0 到 1.0 的位移范围，步长 0.1，生成 11 个层错构型"
msgstr ""
"**Objective:** Generate 11 displacements from 0 to 1.0 Å in 0.1 Å steps on "
"the (111) plane."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:25
#: c547ea0c04cd4ec1ae61dae65b970bbd
msgid "**参数设置：**"
msgstr "**Parameters:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:26
#: 213dbff8392e470b9eaa35307d26699a
msgid "`h k l` = `[1, 1, 1]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:27
#: 715e284d5c854b61b186a22d80b4e918
msgid "`Step` = `[0.0, 1.0, 0.1]`（单位 Å，沿面内滑移方向）"
msgstr "`Step` = `[0.0,1.0,0.1]` Å along the in-plane slip direction."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:28
#: fb89886796ff41d488498c31dc0b49e5
msgid "`Layers` = `[3]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:30
#: b132b57796fe4a7a8b934d87c1cda4e5
msgid ""
"**输出：** 11 个结构（位移 0.0, 0.1, 0.2, ..., 1.0），上层原子相对下层整体平移指定距离，带 "
"`SF(hkl=111,d=...)` 标签"
msgstr "**Output:** Eleven shifted structures labeled `SF(hkl=111,d=...)`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:32
#: a4c390dfe4424b0a99b2fe580f5b8018
msgid "**怎么验证训练集质量改善：**"
msgstr "**How to verify that training-set quality improved:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:33
#: 4fd1301b26bd476eafbebef8f2e6ae7b
msgid "重训后重新计算 GSFE 曲线，形状和峰值应接近 DFT 参考"
msgstr "After labeling and retraining, compare the full GSFE shape and peak with DFT."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:34
#: 864976130cb44d5ebdcb7cab7ddb4660
msgid "检查位移量最大的构型是否还保持合理键长（不会严重重叠）"
msgstr ""
"Inspect the largest displacement for atom overlap and plausible nearest-"
"neighbor distances."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:35
#: aae7b4f4afd14325ae57b97be8a7a096
msgid "如果只有一条滑移方向不够，换 `hkl` = 110 或 100 覆盖不同滑移系统"
msgstr "Add separate hkl paths when other slip systems are in scope."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:36
#: d9830a110409449c968ede4fb908a211
msgid "步长太长可能漏掉能量鞍点——GSFE 场景建议步长 ≤ 0.05"
msgstr ""
"A coarse step can miss a saddle point; use 0.05 Å or finer when curve "
"resolution requires it."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:38
#: e964be26147f492eaa93d2c7464c1911
msgid "什么时候加这张卡、什么时候不加"
msgstr "When to add this card"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:40
#: e2838f18fdac4139b9e10d1d44956e1b
msgid "**加：**"
msgstr "**Add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:41
#: 689f4ac003d34c0d809b90c351c4aad4
msgid "模型对层错能、堆垛缺陷、滑移路径预测差"
msgstr "Stacking-fault energies or slip paths are inaccurate"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:42
#: 9dba6495828941f8acde081bf53ff897
msgid "研究塑性、位错、相变相关的力学性质"
msgstr "Plasticity, dislocations, or transformation mechanics are in scope"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:43
#: e4e108961dda4e7186aeb17de891fdd8
msgid "训练集只有完美晶格，缺少层间位移自由度样本"
msgstr "Training contains only perfect lattices and no interlayer displacement"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:45
#: dc7a3d0419744503b4e6a61979df67e8
msgid "**不加：**"
msgstr "**Do not add it when:**"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:46
#: 01a4d867627440eb8d4beda6d2cb7c19
msgid "体系不关心塑性/位错，只做弹性或振动性质"
msgstr "Only elastic or vibrational properties are needed"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:47
#: e2ef35e891974f8d891090916ab0d8bb
msgid "体系不是层状或晶体结构（如非晶、分子液体）"
msgstr "The system has no meaningful crystalline slip plane"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:49
#: 8d057abcac974bd5b45d8fbf02bc4c8f
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:51
#: 92aff5515612479bb0546fbb8969458f
msgid "HKL（hkl）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:53
#: db531616ee2b4b399485d7e7c460ac1f
msgid "`Sequence[int]`，默认 (1, 1, 1)。Miller 指数，定义你要切哪个晶面做滑移。"
msgstr "`Sequence[int]`, default `(1,1,1)`. Miller indices of the slip plane."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:55
#: d4d354e28b244899a5f57428d868a999
msgid ""
"低指数面（111, 110, 100）是最常见的滑移系统，你应该先从这几个试起。中指数（222, "
"311）对应次密排面，高指数（333+）是更高阶滑移系统——先用低指数验证通了再往上走。"
msgstr ""
"Begin with physically relevant low-index slip planes such as 111, 110, or "
"100. Validate geometry and energy before adding higher-index paths."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:57
#: 2a8fa7e51f464289b81d434bb63cb7b7
msgid "Step（step）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:59
#: 6ed7ccde636b4972926702d74d84e923
msgid ""
"`Sequence[float]`，默认 (0.0, 1.0, 0.5)。`[起始, 结束, 步长]`，单位 Å。沿 hkl "
"面内滑移方向平移上层原子，分层方向由 hkl 法向决定。"
msgstr ""
"`Sequence[float]`, default `(0.0,1.0,0.5)`. `[start,stop,step]` in Å. Atoms "
"above the cut move in plane, while hkl defines the layer normal."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:61
#: f213498be8c048ef9a50975a5e1387d7
msgid ""
"步长越小、范围越宽，输出的层错构型越多。保守用 `[0.0, 0.3, 0.1]` 出 4 个点；平衡用 `[0.0, 0.6, 0.1]` 出 7 "
"个点；如果你要扫完整 GSFE 曲线，用 `[0.0, 1.0, 0.05]` 出 21 个点。"
msgstr ""
"Smaller steps and wider ranges produce more outputs: `[0.0,0.3,0.1]` gives "
"four points, `[0.0,0.6,0.1]` seven, and `[0.0,1.0,0.05]` 21."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:63
#: 0c8f4304e3614db984e8d7d11cd6fa3a
msgid "Layers（layers）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:65
#: 19e3866baa404bd38964bceb7e82affb
msgid "`int`，默认 1。从第几层开始做相对位移。"
msgstr "`int`, default `1`. Layer from which the upper part begins to move."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:67
#: 665c0ad1e4da4250b0cd3cee3cf1ff16
msgid "单层滑移（1）覆盖绝大多数需求；多层滑移（2-5）适合研究厚 slab 中间层的错排行为。"
msgstr ""
"A first-layer cut covers many cases; indices 2-5 can target internal layers "
"of a thick slab."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:69
#: a87e14cd7e18489facb666bfcd2b4c27
msgid "推荐预设"
msgstr "Recommended presets"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:71
#: 8cdde596fe26459ebd96c5ebaa409459
msgid "快速验证（(111) 面，粗步长 0.1，4 个点）"
msgstr "Quick validation ((111), 0.1 Å step, four points)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:72
#: 8f9f3d26936e4ae684081c5af359de6c
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"StackingFaultCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"hkl\": [1, 1, 1],\n"
"  \"step\": [0.0, 0.3, 0.1],\n"
"  \"layers\": [1]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:82
#: 0eafefd862d941baa7f22e9ba1d65f6f
msgid "常规 GSFE 曲线（(111) 面，步长 0.05，13 个点）"
msgstr "Routine GSFE curve ((111), 0.05 Å step, 13 points)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:83
#: fe79d9a5a905477a9055de2b18785e0e
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"StackingFaultCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"hkl\": [1, 1, 1],\n"
"  \"step\": [0.0, 0.6, 0.05],\n"
"  \"layers\": [1]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:93
#: 2c58aa69db1b4afd9f447a4fdd5857ba
msgid "全位移路径覆盖（(111) 面，步长 0.1，11 个点）"
msgstr "Full displacement path ((111), 0.1 Å step, 11 points)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:94
#: b1be9fe1dba24fcdaed6eef35a41bcdd
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"class\": \"StackingFaultCard\",\n"
"  \"check_state\": true,\n"
"  \"hkl\": [1, 1, 1],\n"
"  \"step\": [0.0, 1.0, 0.1],\n"
"  \"layers\": [2]\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:104
#: cdb0597362ad4cafb7d72ab8202a86aa
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:106
#: a1c90ae4aa0b422993caa226d1d1b501
msgid "`Stacking Fault` → `Atomic Perturb`：层错 + 局域坐标噪声，同时覆盖缺陷和热扰动"
msgstr ""
"`Stacking Fault` -> `Atomic Perturb`: add local finite-temperature geometry "
"around each fault displacement"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:107
#: cabdc05f537f45e1bb90d6575243a4c5
msgid "`Super Cell` → `Stacking Fault`：先扩胞，再在足够大的胞里做层错"
msgstr ""
"`Super Cell` -> `Stacking Fault`: establish a sufficient cell before "
"creating the fault"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:108
#: b3bbfa82084043aa9a54b51642ec4bf8
msgid "多条不同 hkl 的 Stacking Fault 卡并联：覆盖不同滑移系统"
msgstr ""
"Parallel Stacking Fault cards with different hkl values cover distinct slip "
"systems"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:110
#: ff3f8189efc840c5a9f96c129aaaa416
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Common questions"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:112
#: f99197d0bf1b4a7b9cc0f5508e0d3bae
msgid "**输出只有一个结构。** 步长 ≤ 0 或 step 的 start == end 时只产生一个结构。"
msgstr "**Only one output.** Check for a positive step and a nonzero scan interval."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:114
#: 86b464036dbf4ac783e38c9b7e00ab42
msgid "**位移后原子严重重叠。** 小步长（如 0.05）通常不会。大步长（如 0.5+）在密集晶面可能产生重叠，抽查最近邻距离。"
msgstr ""
"**Atoms overlap after displacement.** Dense planes and large steps can "
"create overlaps. Reduce the range/step and inspect nearest-neighbor "
"distances."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:116
#: 4ed921e61ddf42f69c1be2641aaf2e35
msgid "**层错面不是我想要的。** 确认 hkl 定义的面法向是否与你的预期滑移面一致。"
msgstr ""
"**The fault plane is wrong.** Confirm that the hkl normal corresponds to the"
" intended slip plane in the input cell orientation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:118
#: f5322f56f8e74f128335930cdb4b0cea
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:120
#: fa1eb47cbf084d758fb6b309d9416e65
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`SF(hkl={h}{k}{l},d={位移量})`"
msgstr "`SF(hkl={h}{k}{l},d={displacement})`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:122
#: e47a8a93a2804d3194b7cba78e533042
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/stacking-fault-card.md:124
#: fdc283355bd44f55838b747cd3309b84
msgid "无随机性。同参数同输入 → 严格一致输出。"
msgstr "Deterministic: identical inputs and parameters produce identical outputs."
